    {
      "start": 19.247,
      "end": 19.527,
      "text": "Enemies created a thick smokescreen by burning bushes near the outer walls.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "Map of the operations of the Tirah Field Force of 1897\u201398 during the Tirah campaign in Tirah, North-West Frontier of India, mapped by John Fawkes.jpg",
